  "name": "Chaos Rising Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Chaos Rising prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 9–10 and 16–17 May 2026. Each box held four Chaos Rising booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Chaos Rising logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Delphox, Ampharos, Crobat and Goodra, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
